          {
            "VAR?": "picnic_taught"
          },
          "/ev",
          [
            {
              "->": ".^.b",
              "c": true
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^Ivanka is by the trees. Call her: «Іванко, ходи сюди!» And remember, only in Ukrainian. ",
                "#",
                "^speaker:npc_olena",
                "/#",
                "\n",
                "end",
                {
                  "->": "0.11"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          "nop",
          "\n",
          "^Привіт! There you are. Everything is ready, I just need my daughter back. Can you call her? She's by the trees. ",
          "#",
          "^speaker:npc_olena",
          "/#",
          "\n",
          "ev",
          "str",
          "^Привіт! Sure. (Hi! Sure.)",
          "/str",
          "/ev",
          {
            "*": "0.c-0",
            "flg": 20
          },
          "ev",
          "str",
          "^Can I just say it in English?",
          "/str",
          "/ev",
          {
            "*": "0.c-1",
            "flg": 20
          },
          {
            "c-0": [
              "\n",
              "^Great!",
              "\n",
              {
                "->": "0.g-0"
              },
              {
                "#f": 5
              }
            ],
            "c-1": [
              "\n",
              "^In Ukrainian. Ivanka doesn't speak English, not a word. She's six.",
              "\n",
              {
                "->": "0.g-0"
              },
              {
                "#f": 5
              }
            ],
            "g-0": [
              "^Just tell her the picnic is ready.",
              "\n",
              "ev",
              "str",
              "^How do you say \"picnic\"?",
              "/str",
              "/ev",
              {
                "*": ".^.c-2",
                "flg": 20
              },
              {
                "c-2": [
                  "\n",
                  {
                    "->": "0.g-1"
                  },
                  {
                    "#f": 5
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "g-1": [
              "^That one you get for free. «Пікнік». Almost the same as your English word, just read it with the letters you already know. Пік-нік. Try it. ",
              "#",
              "^quiz:picnic_read_1",
              "/#",
              "\n",
              "ev",
              {
                "VAR?": "quiz_ok"
              },
              "/ev",
              [
                {
                  "->": ".^.b",
                  "c": true
                },
                {
                  "b": [
                    "\n",
                    "^Exactly!",
                    "\n",
                    {
                      "->": "0.g-1.10"
                    },
                    null
                  ]
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "->": ".^.b"
                },
                {
                  "b": [
                    "\n",
                    "^«Пікнік», picnic. П is p, І is ee, К is k, Н is n.",
                    "\n",
                    {
                      "->": "0.g-1.10"
                    },
                    null
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "nop",
              "\n",
              "^And \"ready\" is «готовий». Together: «Пікнік готовий». How would you tell Ivanka the picnic is ready? ",
              "#",
              "^quiz:picnic_ready_1",
              "/#",
              "\n",
              "ev",
              {
                "VAR?": "quiz_ok"
              },
              "/ev",
              [
                {
                  "->": ".^.b",
                  "c": true
                },
                {
                  "b": [
                    "\n",
                    "^Perfect. Short and clear.",
                    "\n",
                    {
                      "->": "0.g-1.22"
                    },
                    null
                  ]
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "->": ".^.b"
                },
                {
                  "b": [
                    "\n",
                    "^It's «Пікнік готовий». The other phrases mean something else.",
                    "\n",
                    {
                      "->": "0.g-1.22"
                    },
                    null
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "nop",
              "\n",
              "^One more thing. When you call her, it's «Іванко», not «Іванка». Ukrainian changes a name when you call someone. «Іванко, ходи сюди» means \"Ivanka, come here\". Which one calls her? ",
              "#",
              "^quiz:picnic_call_1",
              "/#",
              "\n",
              "ev",
              {
                "VAR?": "quiz_ok"
              },
              "/ev",
              [
                {
                  "->": ".^.b",
                  "c": true
                },
                {
                  "b": [
                    "\n",
                    "^Yes! Now go. She's by the trees on the right.",
                    "\n",
                    {
                      "->": "0.g-1.34"
                    },
                    null
                  ]
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "->": ".^.b"
                },
                {
                  "b": [
                    "\n",
                    "^It's «Іванко, ходи сюди». Names change when you call someone. Now go, she's by the trees on the right.",
                    "\n",
                    {
                      "->": "0.g-1.34"
                    },
                    null
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "nop",
              "\n",
              "ev",
              true,
              "/ev",
              {
                "VAR=": "picnic_taught",
                "re": true
              },
              "end",
              [
                "done",
                {
                  "#n": "g-2"
                }
              ],
              null
            ]
          }
        ],
        "done",
        {
          "feast": [
            [
              "^Ivanka comes running after you. ",
              "#",
              "^speaker:narrator",
              "/#",
              "\n",
              "^«Мамо! Пікнік!» (Mom! Picnic!) ",
              "#",
              "^speaker:npc_ivanka",
              "/#",
              "\n",
              "^I heard you from here. «Пікнік готовий», perfect. ",
              "#",
              "^speaker:npc_olena",
              "/#",
              "\n",
              "^«А що є?» (And what is there?) ",
              "#",
              "^speaker:npc_ivanka",
              "/#",
              "\n",
              "^«Салат, лимонад, банани і торт.» Did you catch that? You knew all four already. ",
              "#",
              "^speaker:npc_olena",
              "/#",
