                  "nop",
                  "\n",
                  "^Ukrainian hands you a few hundred words like that for free, you only have to be able to read them. «Смачного!» (Enjoy your meal!)",
                  "\n",
                  "ev",
                  "str",
                  "^Смачного! (Enjoy your meal!)",
                  "/str",
                  "/ev",
                  {
                    "*": ".^.c-2",
                    "flg": 20
